Add initial support for the LG V60 ThinQ 5G (timelm), based on the
Qualcomm SM8250 SoC.

Describe the memory layout, PMIC regulators, buttons, serial console,
UFS, SD card, and USB.

Signed-off-by: rofikkerneldev <rofikcoga@gmail.com>
